<h3>出典</h3>
<ol class="refs">
  <li id="thy-r1"><span class="rf-for">FIR フィルタの設計</span><span class="rf-src">A. V. Oppenheim, R. W. Schafer, <i>Discrete-Time Signal Processing</i>, 3rd ed., Pearson, 2010, 7 章</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r2"><span class="rf-for">カイザー窓と Kaiser の式</span><span class="rf-src">J. F. Kaiser, “Nonrecursive Digital Filter Design Using the I<sub>0</sub>-sinh Window Function,” <i>Proc. IEEE ISCAS</i>, 1974</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r3"><span class="rf-for">窓の遷移帯域幅と阻止域の減衰</span><span class="rf-src">E. C. Ifeachor, B. W. Jervis, <i>Digital Signal Processing: A Practical Approach</i>, 2nd ed., Prentice Hall, 2002</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r4"><span class="rf-for">等リップル（Parks–McClellan 法）</span><span class="rf-src">T. W. Parks, J. H. McClellan, “Chebyshev Approximation for Nonrecursive Digital Filters with Linear Phase,” <i>IEEE Trans. Circuit Theory</i>, CT-19(2), 1972</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r5"><span class="rf-for">Remez の交換法</span><span class="rf-src">J. H. McClellan, T. W. Parks, L. R. Rabiner, “A Computer Program for Designing Optimum FIR Linear Phase Digital Filters,” <i>IEEE Trans. Audio Electroacoust.</i>, AU-21(6), 1973</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">最小二乗法</span><span class="rf-src">C. S. Burrus, A. W. Soewito, R. A. Gopinath, “Least Squared Error FIR Filter Design with Transition Bands,” <i>IEEE Trans. Signal Processing</i>, 40(6), 1992</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r7"><span class="rf-for">IIR フィルタの次数</span><span class="rf-src">S. J. Orfanidis, “<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220626012950/https://www.ece.rutgers.edu/~orfanidi/ece521/notes.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lecture Notes on Elliptic Filter Design</a>,” Rutgers University, 2006</span></li>
</ol>
